  "title": "Datadog US1 - Real user monitoring, distribution and custom processes metrics delayed",
  "text": "Service: Datadog US1\nIncident: Real user monitoring, distribution and custom processes metrics delayed\nStatus: resolved\nImpact: minor\nStarted: 2026-07-29T11:41:51.906-04:00\nResolved: 2026-07-29T13:28:08.443-04:00\nUpdates:\n- 2026-07-29T13:28:08.443-04:00: resolved - This incident has been resolved.\n- 2026-07-29T13:12:00.571-04:00: monitoring - A fix has been implemented and we are monitoring the results.\n- 2026-07-29T12:53:24.445-04:00: identified - The RUM delays have been resolved. We're continuing to mitigate the issues on distribution metrics.\n- 2026-07-29T12:35:04.667-04:00: identified - The issue has been identified and a fix is being implemented.\n- 2026-07-29T11:42:12.792-04:00: investigating - We are continuing to investigate this issue.\n- 2026-07-29T11:41:51.970-04:00: investigating - We are currently investigating an issue delaying the ingestion of Real User Monitoring (RUM) measure metrics, custom process metrics, and a subset of distribution metrics for some customers.\n\nAs a result, some users may see delays or gaps in RUM, custom process, and distribution metrics. To prevent false alerts caused by delayed data, affected monitors will not notify and will automatically resume once current data is available. All other monitors will operate normally. No data has been lost.\n\nWe will provide further updates as the situation progresses.",
